cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Frozen-Horizon Cosmology: calculation code"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Numerical implementation of a metric f(R) cosmology with a high-curvature
  trace-flow wall, parameterized by a single integer p. Computes the
  Einstein-frame background, scalar and tensor mode spectra, stochastic exit
  from the frozen horizon, scalaron reheating, and the resulting CMB angular
  power spectra through CAMB.
authors:
